{"repositoryId":1163219967,"availability":"available","full":"rozsazoltan/messenger","name":"messenger","description":"Free unofficial Facebook Messenger desktop client that fills the gap left by Meta's discontinued app. Tiny (just ~5 MB instead of 100-200 MB), fast, distraction-free. No feed, no reels, no marketplace. Just your conversations in a dedicated window. Built with ❤️ & Tauri for Windows, macOS and Linux.","category":"Other","language":"Shell","stars":82,"forks":4,"created":"2026-02-21T09:34:01Z","updated":"2026-09-17T11:32:14Z","license":null,"branch":"master","homepage":"https://messengerdesktop.vercel.app","topics":["desktop-app","distraction-free","facebook","facebook-messenger","facebook-messenger-alternative","lightweight","linux","macos","messenger","messenger-alternative","messenger-app","messenger-desktop","messenger-next","no-electron","standalone","standalone-app","tauri","unofficial","webview","windows"],"demo":"https://messengerdesktop.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T05:04:20.728Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T05:04:20.728Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T05:04:20.728Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:32.466Z","stars":82,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-19T05:04:20.728Z","stars":82,"forks":4}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Messenger Next is built for focused, distraction-free messaging.","Version 1.9 arrives in August with one of the biggest updates yet. Expect configurable notifications, badge support, optional Insider builds for early feature access, better download handling, improved window management, and even lower CPU and RAM usage. The mission stays unchanged: deliver a free, fast, distraction-free Facebook Messenger desktop experience without ads, payments, or telemetry. Download the current version now to receive automatic update notifications and install version 1.9 with one click when released. Excited for the update? Star the repository on GitHub and r